<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Team Management</h1>
<p>Collaborate with your team by inviting members to your workspace.</p>

<h2>Inviting Members</h2>
<ol><li>Go to <strong>Settings → Members</strong></li><li>Click <strong>Invite Member</strong></li><li>Enter their email address</li><li>Choose a role: <strong>Admin</strong> or <strong>Member</strong></li><li>Click <strong>Send Invite</strong></li></ol>
<p>They'll receive an email with an invitation link. Once they accept, they join your workspace.</p>

<h2>Member Limits</h2>
<p>Each plan has a maximum member count. Check your plan's limits at <strong>Settings → Billing</strong>.</p>

<h2>Removing Members</h2>
<p>Workspace owners and admins can remove members at any time from the Members settings page.</p>
